  "Botas Veloces": "Botas Veloces",
  "BOTTOM": "INFERIOR",
  "Bottom matched · Pulse now!": "Parte inferior correspondente · Pulse agora!",
  "Boucle du Sanctuaire Animal": "Animal Boucle du Sanctuaire",
