  "Paint": "Pintar",
  "Paint cells that must be filled, cross cells that must stay empty, and use intersecting clues to solve each mosaic without guessing.": "Pinte as células que devem ser preenchidas, cruze as células que devem permanecer vazias e use pistas que se cruzam para resolver cada mosaico sem adivinhar.",
