  "Run and permanent growth: each wave offers Bigger Orb, Split Orb, Piercing Shine, Faster Recharge, Core Shield, or Scout Magnet according to the current choice cycle. Star Stones earned at Result improve Orb Forge damage, starting Core Shield HP, Companion Den support strikes, and Scout Tower rewards. A three-Diamond blessing reroll is optional, confirmed in two steps, and never required to unlock routes.": "Corrida e crescimento permanente: cada onda oferece Bigger Orb, Split Orb, Piercing Shine, Faster Recharge, Core Shield ou Scout Magnet de acordo com o ciclo de escolha atual. As Star Stones obtidas no Result melhoram o dano do Orb Forge, iniciando o Core Shield HP, os ataques de suporte do Companion Den e as recompensas da Scout Tower. Uma nova rolagem de bênção de três diamantes é opcional, confirmada em duas etapas e nunca é necessária para desbloquear rotas.",
